{
  "_comment": "YomiKoe spoken-maths reading convention (spec _agent/specs/m5-academic-reading.md section 3c; MATH-1..4). One wording per symbol. Loaded by api/scripts/check_math_convention.py and by the phase-3 mathspeak symbol table, so the expected texts and the reader never drift. Edit only together with spec 3c.",
